This package contains code from webtransport-go v0.13.0
(github.com/quic-go/webtransport-go), MIT licensed; see LICENSE. go-qrdb
patches it to build against quic-go v0.65.0, to bound stream buffering before
a session is established, to bound each established session's queue of
streams waiting to be accepted, to open streams without holding the session
close lock, to let a local stream cancel end a wait for session shutdown, to
let CancelWrite and Close return while a Write sends the stream header, and to
wake every waiting acceptor while streams remain queued; README.md lists the
patches.
